<style>
#geo-root{--geo-border:var(--panel-border,#29354b);padding:clamp(14px,3vw,26px);color:var(--panel-text,#f2f4f8);line-height:1.7}#geo-root *{box-sizing:border-box}#geo-root [hidden]{display:none!important}.geo-head,.geo-actions,.geo-tabs{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between}.geo-head h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,25px);line-height:1.6}.geo-muted{color:var(--panel-text-muted,#a5aec1);line-height:1.8}.geo-filters,.geo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin:20px 0}#geo-root label{display:block}#geo-root select,#geo-root textarea{width:100%;margin-top:8px;max-width:100%;font:inherit}#geo-root textarea{min-height:90px;resize:vertical;padding:12px}.geo-next,.geo-box{border:1px solid var(--geo-border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin:14px 0}.geo-next{border-inline-start:4px solid #818cf8}.geo-next h3,.geo-box h3{margin:0 0 10px}.geo-tabs{justify-content:flex-start;border-bottom:1px solid var(--geo-border);padding:14px 0;margin-bottom:18px}.geo-tabs [aria-selected=true]{background:#465cc9;color:#fff}.geo-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.geo-stat{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0}.geo-question{margin:12px 0}.geo-check{display:flex!important;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:12px 0}.geo-check input{width:auto}#geo-message{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--geo-border);border-radius:8px;white-space:pre-wrap}#geo-message[data-error=true]{border-color:#d68472}.geo-scroll{overflow:auto}#geo-root table{min-width:540px;width:100%}#geo-root td{max-width:340px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-wrap}#geo-root summary{cursor:pointer;padding:10px 0}#geo-root button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}#geo-root a:focus-visible,#geo-root button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #a5b4fc;outline-offset:3px}.geo-empty{padding:24px 12px;text-align:center;line-height:1.9;border:1px dashed var(--geo-border);border-radius:10px}.geo-actions{justify-content:flex-start}#geo-llms-draft{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:640px){.geo-filters,.geo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.geo-head{align-items:flex-start}.geo-tabs button{flex:1;padding:10px 6px}.geo-actions .p-btn{width:100%}}
</style>
<section class="p-card" dir="rtl" id="geo-root" data-csrf="<?= htmlspecialchars(Csrf::token(), ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8') ?>">
<div class="geo-head"><div><h2>هل بيظهر اسم شركتك في إجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي؟</h2><div class="geo-muted">راجع أسئلة عملائك، وافق على قياسها، وتابع النتائج ومصادرها.</div></div><button type="button" class="p-btn outline" id="geo-reload">تحديث النتائج</button></div>
